  "title": "The Best Beer Can Chicken Ever",
  "description": "A whole grilled chicken gets a burst of flavor from a warm and complex spice rub and a can of dark stout beer with hot peppers and garlic cloves.",
  "authors": [
    "Laura"
  ],
